Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.75,0:00:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ants live together in colonies,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,which are eusocial, communal,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.39,0:00:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and efficiently organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.89,0:00:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,A typical colony consists of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.43,0:00:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,one or more egg-laying queens,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.65,0:00:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,numerous sterile females, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,seasonally, many winged sexual
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,males and females.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ants undertake flights to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,establish new colonies, with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,swarms of winged sexuals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.33,0:00:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,departing the nest in search
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,of other nests.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The males die shortly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,thereafter, while a small
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,percentage of females survive to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,initiate new nests.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ant colonies operate with a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.63,0:00:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,unified purpose, with each caste
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.89,0:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,playing a vital role in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.94,0:00:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the colony's survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.87,0:00:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ants have colonized almost every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,landmass on Earth.